info: on aws: Fargate needs at least 0.5 vCPU for 4gb; more_memory uses 0.5 vCPU
  --> fargate.clowd:10:3
   |
10 |   cpu 0.25
   |   ^^^^^^^^

info: on aws: Fargate has no 2 vCPU task with 1500mb; odd_memory uses 4gb
